[Peggy Talks Love Psychology]

375
00:21:57,500 --> 00:21:59,000
I'm Ms. Peggy.

376
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:00,430
What I'm going to talk about today

377
00:22:00,430 --> 00:22:01,750
is a bit more difficult.

378
00:22:01,750 --> 00:22:03,400
What I want to talk about today

379
00:22:03,400 --> 00:22:04,910
is a psychological defense mechanism

380
00:22:04,910 --> 00:22:05,390
called

381
00:22:05,410 --> 00:22:06,950
Reaction Formation.

382
00:22:06,950 --> 00:22:08,750
Reaction Formation.

383
00:22:08,750 --> 00:22:10,040
This psychological defense mechanism

384
00:22:10,040 --> 00:22:10,760
is a kind of

385
00:22:10,790 --> 00:22:13,370
unconscious one.

386
00:22:13,370 --> 00:22:15,140
It is usually used to maintain

387
00:22:15,160 --> 00:22:16,500
our confidence or self-esteem.

388
00:22:15,210 --> 00:22:15,890
[Confidence]

389
00:22:15,920 --> 00:22:16,300
[Confidence] [Self-esteem]

390
00:22:16,500 --> 00:22:18,000
And this reaction formation

391
00:22:18,000 --> 00:22:19,110
usually works like this:

392
00:22:19,110 --> 00:22:21,160
In order to hide our true feelings,

393
00:22:21,160 --> 00:22:22,960
we will deliberately act out

394
00:22:22,990 --> 00:22:25,500
the exact opposite emotions or behaviors.

395
00:22:25,500 --> 00:22:26,240
For example,

396
00:22:26,260 --> 00:22:28,370
you really want something,

397
00:22:28,370 --> 00:22:30,790
but you never mention it.

398
00:22:30,790 --> 00:22:31,980
Or,

399
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:34,000
you really hate a certain colleague,

400
00:22:34,000 --> 00:22:35,220
but when you talk to them,

401
00:22:35,220 --> 00:22:36,190
you are especially polite

402
00:22:36,190 --> 00:22:37,160
and courteous.

403
00:22:37,160 --> 00:22:38,950
In romantic relationships,

404
00:22:38,980 --> 00:22:40,160
it also often happens.

405
00:22:40,160 --> 00:22:41,790
For example,

406
00:22:41,790 --> 00:22:43,290
you obviously like this person very much,

407
00:22:43,290 --> 00:22:45,040
but you pretend not to care.

408
00:22:45,060 --> 00:22:45,910
Okay, in order to

409
00:22:45,910 --> 00:22:48,910
protect our self-esteem,

410
00:22:48,910 --> 00:22:50,910
we may not be able to honestly

411
00:22:50,910 --> 00:22:53,160
and truly display our emotions,

412
00:22:53,160 --> 00:22:55,790
so we use opposite actions
to protect ourselves.

